# backupattest sample restore drill log, hand authored as a test vector.
# Format: <timestamp> <backup_id> <outcome> [note]
# The interval directive declares how often a drill should run.
#
# Declared interval is 7 days. Measured against the default now (the newest
# backup at 2026-08-04T18:00:00Z), the last successful drill on 2026-07-20 is
# more than 7 days old, so it is stale on purpose.

interval 7

2026-07-06T10:00:00Z f-1 ok  restored to staging, checksums matched
2026-07-13T10:00:00Z i-a2 fail truncated archive, restore abandoned
2026-07-20T10:00:00Z f-1 ok  restored to staging, boot verified
